\newlabel{fig:frontiers}{{2}{6}{\textbf {Operational Alert-Budget Performance Frontier.} Panel A displays episode-level positive predictive value (PPV \%) across prespecified alert budgets. Panel B displays the Number Needed to Evaluate (NNE) per detected patient under a 12-hour alert suppression rule. Lines illustrate trends across evaluated budget tiers; complete bootstrap confidence intervals and boundary-degenerate notes are reported in Table~\ref {tab:table3}}{figure.caption.4}{}}
